  "_comment": "Generated monsters (Dwarf Fortress style): a body profile (with what it must and cannot have), a structural tweak, a class or a uniform substance, a class tweak or odd eyes, a special attack, colours from its spheres, and a description assembled from fragments that each choice owns, so the words cannot contradict the body. Weights are relative; 'spheres' bias a choice toward worlds and lairs that share them.",

